WEBVTT

00:01:59.875 --> 00:02:01.559
And then about two seconds later,

00:02:01.583 --> 00:02:03.268
somebody picks up their cell phone

00:02:03.292 --> 00:02:07.518
and begins sending a text message
to somebody else in the same meeting,

00:02:07.542 --> 00:02:09.708
telling them how stupid the idea is.

00:02:10.750 --> 00:02:14.143
And let's not forget the proverbial
watercooler conversations.

00:02:14.167 --> 00:02:15.893
As soon as the meeting over,

00:02:15.917 --> 00:02:18.601
they rush over to a peer or
a group of coworkers

00:02:18.625 --> 00:02:20.226
probably near a watercooler

00:02:20.250 --> 00:02:23.393
and offer all kinds of opinions
about that meeting.

00:02:23.417 --> 00:02:25.643
But the problem is
that it's after the meeting

00:02:25.667 --> 00:02:27.059
instead of during it.

00:02:27.083 --> 00:02:28.434
So I'm on a mission.

00:02:28.458 --> 00:02:31.393
I want to stop
the passive-aggressive texting